  "text": "Special\nOffers\n\nNeed a closer look? Buy a sample\nColor\n\nKenai\nShale Gray with Deep Earthy Tones\n\nKenai Outside Corner\n18\" x 22.5\" or 2.81 SQFT\n\nHome Faux Stone Panels Kenai Kenai Outside Corner\nThe 90° outside corner piece eliminates the need to miter panels when your installation demands a transition into another wall. This piece also creates the necessary offset pattern throughout the install. The positive shiplap edge along the left side of the piece allows panels joining from the left to slide under the corner. The negative shiplap edge on the right side provides a reliable connection to any panel installed to its right.\n\n$ 64.99 each\n\n- Kenai Outside Corner quantity +\nAdd to cart\n\nCalculator Project SOS\n\n+209 pictures\n\nGet everything you need\n\nGuides & Downloads\n\nReviews\nProduct Knowledge\nSpecs\n\nThe 90° outside corner piece eliminates the need to miter panels when your installation demands a transition into another wall. This piece also creates the necessary offset pattern throughout the install. The positive shiplap edge along the left side of the piece allows panels joining from the left to slide under the corner. The negative shiplap edge on the right side provides a reliable connection to any panel installed to its right.",
